  "bio": "Situated in the heart of New Braunfels, Jess Coveritup is renowned for her exceptional skill in illustrative and coverup tattoos. Her studio mirrors her professionalism, providing a pristine environment that ensures each client's comfort and safety. Jess's portfolio showcases a diverse range of designs, inviting patrons to bring any idea to life with confidence in her expertise.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: New Braunfels, Texas, United States"
